  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NorCross contribution to stronger RCRC movement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NorCross contribution to stronger RCRC movement. Support to the Red Cross Red Crescent Movement&#x2019;s members (national societies) through allocations to the Disaster Relief Emergency Fund, to allow preparation for and response to small and medium-sized natural disasters, and to the International Federation of Red Cross Red Crescent (IFRC)&#x2019;s preparedness and response capacity in emergencies, through positions within disaster management.</narrative>
  </description>
